ual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +80% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at -13% against a 9% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests, with gross margins sitting at 34%.","The company is burning through $606M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","Accruals are elevated at +25.9% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably conservative at 0.9\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and interest coverage of 28\u00d7 is fortress-like.","Management returns a meaningful 9.2% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insiders hold 4.0% of the shares, and within its sector the business captures 1.6\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Accruals elevated at +25.9% of assets \u2014 Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (42.9% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Financial Services peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Insiders are overwhelmingly selling (100% sell ratio) \u2014 the people who know the business want less of it","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","ratio":0.0},{"text":"Value-trap profile (score 57/100): structural revenue/margin decli